# CR 111.13, 707.10f: "whenever you create one or more creature tokens" is not met by the token a copy of a permanent spell
# becomes as it resolves, which is not created. Bot1 casts Staff of the Storyteller on turn 1 (its Spirit puts a story counter
# on it: the positive control) and Entombs an Ornithopter; on turn 3 Uldaros Theorix exiles the Ornithopter and the sacrificed Black
# Lotus and casts copies of both. The Ornithopter token is a creature token that enters, and the Staff keeps its one counter.

